<title>SINGAPORE: Osprey Maritime 1st-half net up 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Osprey Maritime 1st-half net up 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of US$ unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    7.61  vs  7.03</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	5.28  vs  4.87</p>
<p>    Turnover		     33.40  vs 29.37</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  8.09  vs  7.41</p>
<p>    Vessel operating cost    10.60  vs  8.27</p>
<p>    Administration cost	 2.71  vs  1.93</p>
<p>    Associates		    0.83  vs  0.14</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   12.82  vs 11.89</p>
<p>    Interest income	     0.90  vs  0.86</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    5.54  vs  5.64</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 8.19  vs  7.12</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.24  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Minority losses	     0.34  vs  0.09</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
